power: supply: sc27xx_fuel_gauge: the status from the U30 Air's charger

With the U30 Air's charger driven by bq256xx (patch 0009), the fuel gauge takes Charging, Not charging, Full and
Discharging from it, as it does from the SC27xx chargers, instead of guessing from the battery current (0006's
fallback, which said Full at 3.88 V on a charger that Android had left switched off). The charger names the fuel
gauge in its supplied_to, so a plug or unplug is passed on.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/sc27xx_fuel_gauge.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/sc27xx_fuel_gauge.c
@@ -166,6 +166,7 @@
 	"sc2720_charger",
 	"sc2721_charger",
 	"sc2723_charger",
+	"bq256xx-charger",	/* MU300: the U30 Air's SGM41511 (patch 0009) */
 };
 
 static int sc27xx_fgu_adc_to_current(struct sc27xx_fgu_data *data, s64 adc)
